{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "9e24b0e7-8983-439d-b803-451d53c39851",
    "name": "MX - Reporting",
    "description": "This Postman collection supports API testing of the MX Proxy – Reporting endpoints. It is intended for validating reporting-related APIs and passthrough data retrieval via the MX Proxy.\n\n# Quick Links\n\n- [Passthrough Read](https://extensibility-api.postman.co/workspace/68b02a61-3965-420f-b3b8-3bd911f20b6a/folder/8321995-de9f9030-5648-49e1-8a52-0e0801dc4cdd?action=share&source=copy-link&creator=8321995)",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "8321995",
    "_collection_link": "https://go.postman.co/collection/8321995-9e24b0e7-8983-439d-b803-451d53c39851?source=collection_link"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "🔗 Passthrough Read",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1. Generate Access Token",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "const accessToken = jsonData.access_token;",
                  "",
                  "pm.environment.set(\"access_token\", accessToken);"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "packages": {},
                "requests": {}
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "basic",
              "basic": [
                {
                  "key": "password",
                  "value": "{{client_secret}}",
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "key": "username",
                  "value": "{{client_id}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "transactionId",
                "value": "{{$guid}}",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "institutionId",
                "value": "{{institution_id}}",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "urlencoded",
              "urlencoded": [
                {
                  "key": "grant_type",
                  "value": "client_credentials",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{apigee_base_url}}/oauth2/v1/token",
              "host": [
                "{{apigee_base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "oauth2",
                "v1",
                "token"
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "2. Passthrough Read",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "correlationId",
                "value": "{{$guid}}",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "ext_host",
                "value": "{{mx_reporting_host}}",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/vnd.mx.logs.v1+avro",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{apigee_base_url}}/mx/{{mx_reporting_resource_path}}",
              "host": [
                "{{apigee_base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "mx",
                "{{mx_reporting_resource_path}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Forward a read request to the MX API through the Apigee passthrough.\n\n```\nGET /mx/{{mx_reporting_resource_path}}\n```"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ],
      "description": "## 🔄 MX Reporting Passthrough Read Flow\n\n| **Step** | Request Name | **Description** |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | Generate Access Token | Obtain an access token using client credentials to authorize API requests. |\n| 2 | Passthrough Read | Send a GET request through the proxy, mapping to the corresponding MX Platform API resource. |",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "prerequest",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "packages": {},
            "requests": {},
            "exec": [
              ""
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "packages": {},
        "requests": {},
        "exec": [
          "// Pre-request script to check for required environment variables at the collection level",
          "const requiredVars = [",
          "    \"apigee_base_url\",",
          "    \"client_id\",",
          "    \"client_secret\",",
          "    \"institution_id\",",
          "    \"mx_reporting_host\"",
          "];",
          "",
          "const missingVars = requiredVars.filter(varName => !pm.environment.get(varName));",
          "",
          "if (missingVars.length > 0) {",
          "    throw new Error(",
          "        `Missing required environment variables: ${missingVars.join(\", \")}. Please set them in the active environment before running requests.`",
          "    );",
          "}"
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
